					<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone  wp-image-11822" src="/wp-content/uploads/Glass-Water-Wall-at-Holiday-Inn-Houston-Airport-31.jpg" alt="Glass Water Wall at Holiday Inn Houston Airport 31" width="596" height="447" title="How Corporate Offices are Leveraging Custom Water Features to Attract Clients 1"></p>
